      ],
      "normalized_claim": "At June 30, 2026 Nebius reported $8.0421 billion of cash and cash equivalents, $1.0560 billion of restricted cash, approximately $8.5 billion of noncurrent debt, and approximately $6.0 billion of current and noncurrent deferred revenue, so headline cash must be assessed together with debt, restrictions, and prepaid delivery obligations."
    },
