      "normalized_claim": "Nebius disclosed large financing inflows from convertibles, a pre-funded warrant, treasury-share sales and its at-the-market program; during Q2 it sold 12.7 million Class A shares for approximately $2.8 billion gross and retained capacity to sell a further 12.3 million shares under the program."
    },
